Package: libukui-previewhub1
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: libreoffice-core | libreoffice-writer
Description: Embeddable Qt5 file preview widget library
 This shared library provides file content preview (text, images, audio,
 video, PDF, Office documents via LibreOffice) for embedding in
 third-party applications on X11 or Wayland sessions. It does not depend
 on the Peony file manager libraries.

Package: libukui-previewhub-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libukui-previewhub1 (= ${binary:Version}),
 qtbase5-dev,
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for ukui-previewhub
 This package provides the headers, pkg-config metadata and unversioned
 shared library symlink needed to build applications against
 libukui-previewhub.
